{"version":1,"key":"card:251","content":{"id":251,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e88c9b0f-2a3a-4546-aee5-0f741b69765c","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 变量可以作为对象的属性，但是当我们通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"for...in"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 以及 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"getOwnPropertyNames"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 都不能获得 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"0bb5de9f-7d87-46ae-94fd-61a1c836e1bc","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ac2e8e56-4043-48ff-a756-7e1ea6a41976","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let age = Symbol(\"age\");\nlet person = {\n  name: \"Alice\",\n  [age]: 28,\n};\n\nfor (let key in person) {\n  console.log(key); // name\n}\n\nconsole.log(Object.getOwnPropertyNames(person)); // [ 'name' ]","collabId":"b869802d-6ab1-4403-94a5-273ddf3fc17d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0560bf88-aa24-445f-9762-6987543c96d0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要获得 Symbol 类的属性，要通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.getOwnPropertySymbols"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"54396f7f-0bcb-44e1-977b-9d0f1df58e87","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"592bbc03-d4a4-4a13-81f3-09a847b15dd2","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"console.log(Object.getOwnPropertySymbols(person)); // [ Symbol(age) ]","collabId":"c0d4e718-334b-4385-b0a8-0a083140f1a4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"],"createTime":1690986103939,"updateTime":1743303640412,"linkedCards":[{"id":249,"target":{"key":"card:249","type":"card","id":249},"summary":"Symbol 是 ES6 引入的一种新的原始类型，类型的值唯一的，每个被创建出来的 Symbol 变量都是不同的，这是 Symbol 这种数据类型最大的特点，常常用于作为对象的属性，以防止被不正确篡改。 Symbol 不能通过字面量来进行创...","tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640412}}